Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,either will I'm feeling alive,\Nlook out below, wake up sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high,\Nhail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky, time\Nto journey on, on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves!.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad just at first!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, feel it's waiting!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling alive!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up sunshine, here we go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very first\Nday, I'd make my name!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the decade that followed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the remaining members of the royal\Nfamily, including the king himself,?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,rarely left the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but chose to speak to the nation\Nthrough their monitors instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the while, the islander's\Nsignature steadily replenished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how we spent the past 16\Nyears fighting discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how the Fishman\NPirates were formed and divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no denying the awful\Nthings Arlong did to your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, at one time, he\Nwas like a brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When we received news of his violent actions\Nwe took it upon ourselves to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But he always managed to\Ndodge any real consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He hid his actions from the navy by\Nbribing any soldiers that he came across.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I let him live and in failing to stop\Nhim I too share the guilt for his crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so sorry kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji take responsibility pay with your\Nlife for the suffering that you caused her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give her peace that's\Nenough Sanji what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,serious Nami how could\Nyou excuse the things they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did to you I'll never\Nexcuse what Arlong did
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But Jinbe, he never meant\Nfor anyone to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will accept any punishment if you\Nwish for me to take my own life drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one I hate is Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.64,0:04:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me I'm relieved to hear you're\Nnot the mastermind of the Arlong Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're a friend of Luffy's\Nwhich tells me plenty about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Arlong Pirates made\Nmy life a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know if it wasn't for that\Nnightmare I never would have met my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That awful time made me who I am. I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,hate you just because you're a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So you you don't get to pity\Nme just because of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with my past because\NI'm happy in the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who did\Nthis to me don't become angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,not on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please you can't tell anyone on the island
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the tragedy that we've endured?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and our hatred must die with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dwell on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've known each other\Nsince childhood, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Like him or not, he's still like a\Nbrother to you and you're no killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to be treated so kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You... Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good man, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how hard it is to be a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a hell of a guy, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That whole story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I like them all so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger and Odashime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been carrying so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't need that nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, what did the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,end up doing to that beast you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you fell asleep at the\Nvery beginning of the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I miss it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's royalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so casual, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive me for being so emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's difficult not to cry\Nwhen I think about my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She sounds like she was quite the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real pleasure to meet you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-chin is just a silly nickname I gave\Nher, so it's just plain Nami, no chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps it's a bit\Nforward of me to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but even though we just met,\NI feel a connection to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,like we've been friends for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've both been through\Nsome similar rough patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I just lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know what the\Nsituation is at the Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to confirm what you've told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart and his crew have taken the\NKing and the Palace Guards captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Apart from that, you're not sure what\Nhappened to three members of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all the\Ninformation we have, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinbe, if the siege is\Nplaying out as Heart planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance the rest of the\Ncountry is falling to his forces now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you know what his plan is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have had my suspicions he was up to\Nsomething ever since he retired from the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was clever enough to\Nkeep the details hidden from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, let me warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart hates humans even\Nmore than Arlong did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing driving him is resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He talks about rebuilding the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but all he really wants to do\Nis cause suffering to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And to prove my point, you'll see there's\None big difference between him and Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong had no problem with killing humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but the one thing he'd never\Ndo is hurt other fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart, he doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll also turn his fury against\Nfishmen who are sympathetic to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll cut down anyone in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The World Summit is set\Nto take place again soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but a lot's changed in\Nthe last four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time since Odohime's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,they've actually gathered enough\Nsignatures for King Neptune to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,speak at the summit about relocating\NFishman Island to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Hortius seized the\Npalace just for that? I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid it's a lot worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a video transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it's projecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He found us? Hodges!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, people of Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I coming through?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,for those of you who don't know, I'm\Nthe captain of the new Fishman Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Heart Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Queen Otohime would forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I refused, it would kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's even trying to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,People are stomping on her\Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to come see this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Horty's live on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's the one behind\Nall this. The bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he want us to\Nstuff on the queen so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he also the soldier from the plaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed Otsuhime's assassin that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Heart Jones. The same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would one of that team\Nsoldiers do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something every citizen of\Nthe Ryugu kingdom needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be destroyed. And quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rebuild it from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But with a new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is? Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this broadcast even coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat supposedly\Ntook over the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're his allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes sense anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I will usher in a new era for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, we'll end all\Nfriendly relations with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In place of the sympathizers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,those loyal to our cause will\Nmove in from the Fishman District.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They hate humans too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And will do whatever it takes to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,rid this country of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So treat them with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he serious? New residents?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just gonna let all these criminals\Nroam free through our kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You still love her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime, our most cherished queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She was indeed selfless\Nand worked tirelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to build a bridge between\Nfishmen and humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I do respect her spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But have you forgotten\Nthe end of her tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She was killed by a no-man Even if you\Napproach them with a pure heart and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,kind intentions They'll just take\Nadvantage of you and leave you in the dirt
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to wake up, can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Woody
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the royal family's\Nbeen duping you for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If we follow them, we'll face extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as humans exist, the\NSkull of Harmony is unattainable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pipe dream that's been\Nperpetuated for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they? Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune got old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It happens to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to advance is\Nto eliminate the old god,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so they won't hold us back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When you think about it, this\Nmess is kind of our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't shown up,\Nthe king might be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,More like Zoro's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world did\Nyou do at the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, wait! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of Neptune soldiers attacked\NNamichin and her friends first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They were just trying\Nto defend themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As you may have figured out by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at the Ryugu Palace, and there's\Nsomething else I want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This here is from the nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen risked her life for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I destroy this letter, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,here we have a box
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,with signatures from\Nmost of Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'm disgusted by the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would want to\Nbefriend humans after all they've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if your name is on\Nany of these, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who I have to weed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My kingdom will be better without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that in mind,\Nwhy don't we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's page one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough stepping on pictures. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too easy to pretend you don't\Nmind doing it just to save yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But these signatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,they give me concrete evidence of who\NI can suspect will oppose my rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you signed\Nyour own death warrant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, let's\Nsee who the traitors are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, before I go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Strat, I know you're there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something that\Nmay be of interest to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As you watch from wherever\Nyou are I want you to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,know that this is just the\Nbeginning of my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For what you did to Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, he even captured Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we get, leaving them\Nalone. But still, all three?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what's this? We're going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't possibly be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time we finish the king's execution,\Nthat room will be completely flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the humans can't survive\Nthat, if I'm not mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Four hundred million!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The heads of you and your\Ncrewmates will serve as
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,a perfect warning to any\Nhumans who dare defy us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, we're tearing\Ndown the old Ryugu kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done with the failures of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time for revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just three hours, that's all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island will take back\Nits pride in three hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ja-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This water isn't getting any lower! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just got dry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's all figure out a way to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or better yet, save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any ideas?\NAny day? I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First, get me out of these chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Psychic powers, don't fail me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chains come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chains come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your links are getting looser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The metal's getting weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chains be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice knowing you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the look on those\Nfishmen's faces when I stood up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy was probably adrift at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I did die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alive, somewhat well. I\Nmay do at least the name's Brook
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we're all gonna die we wouldn't\Nhave gotten caught if it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,weren't for you please help\Nthey're killing me wait never
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:20:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,mind you're killing me too well\Nat least nami and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,escaped soon luffy and the\Nrest of the crew will come
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,get us out of here wishful\Nthinking what if they don't as
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,robin would say oh i hope\Nnami hasn't been eaten by some
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,deep sea creature
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,poneglyph
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,is different from the others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see it looks like a\Nletter as well as an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is this apology for and why\Ndid you engrave it in stone, joy boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,hey that's a lot of money\N400 million where did
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they go up huh no one\Ncares about your bounty
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, they're using\Nthe others as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're infamous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The conflict at Marineford\Nmade sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you surpass 300 million,\Nit rarely increases again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, if someone wants\Nto fight me, I'll fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.38,0:21:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, don't act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My father needs me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Megalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just stay here!\NCome back! Shura Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Megalo, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't save father, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I do understand the urgency,\Nbut please, you must listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.24,0:22:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.15,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The one person that Heart is most afraid\Nof in the Ryugu kingdom is you, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Heart does change the island to\Nsuit his needs, you'll still be a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you summon the sea kings, everything\Nwill come crashing down in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he took King Neptune hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.72,0:22:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to neutralize the princess\Nand to lure her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying this whole time, they've\Nreally been after Shirahoshi? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but not in the way you might think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart doesn't want to capture\Nthe princess to use her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.16,0:22:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This may sound cruel, but he'd prefer\Na threat like her not exist at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he partnered\Nwith Vander Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Deccan is capable of killing\Nher, plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.74,0:23:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll destroy anything\Nthat stands in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart wants the princess\Nto rush into the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There, she would be most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, my family has mentioned my power\Nbefore, but I'm afraid that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you were to ask me to\Ncommunicate with the Sea Kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm not convinced that\NI have the power in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you do or not, Heart has no\Nqualms with killing you just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.94,0:23:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we must not let him find out\Nthat you aren't able to control the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The more afraid of you he is,\Nthe better things are for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shark, take me back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the crybaby\Nwith you. That cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.56,0:23:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I told you to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.16,0:23:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:23:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You people have no\Nbusiness fighting Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight because\Nwe're humans, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense when you two say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit complicating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.87,0:24:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle isn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win, the surviving fishmen\Nwill go on hating humans again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.40,0:24:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when my crew is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.58,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is personal for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.54,0:24:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.04,0:24:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this. Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.38,0:24:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.72,0:24:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a stubborn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.94,0:24:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.84,0:24:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop me if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.08,0:24:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we were allies before, I had\Nhoped that you would honor my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.54,0:25:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How easily I forget who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard-headedness truly\Ndoes run in your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.46,0:25:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to listen\Nto me, I have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you two, try to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Jinbe,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.23,0:25:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,this is no time for you guys to act\Nlike you're going to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.18,0:25:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, I\Ngotta go save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I'm done, I'm\Nkicking Horty's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to get\Ninvolved with him, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, surely there's a\Nbetter way to work this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.76,0:25:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, stop it, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please, I don't\Nwant my friends to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.68,0:25:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark, let's go, get\Nme back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.20,0:25:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go through me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.74,0:25:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Man Caratter, the Shark Brickfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.80,0:26:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.49,0:26:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt. What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's made of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacks like that\Nshouldn't even work on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is Fishman Karate, a\Nform based on manipulating water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can send shockwaves through vapor in the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,air until they finally\Nfind my target's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as every living\Ncreature is made up of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,not even a rubber man\Ncan escape the impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall not pass, Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:26:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.16,0:27:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After so much training, don't\Ntell me that's all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.40,0:27:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.74,0:27:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey get out of the way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.72,0:27:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.02,0:27:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.66,0:27:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you both have your\Nreasons, but you're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.46,0:28:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean Robin's been in\Nthe forest this entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.50,0:28:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.06,0:28:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a damn second!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.60,0:28:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna leave\Nwithout explaining or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.58,0:28:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when have you been able to\Ndo something like this freaky crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.74,0:28:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a new trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.38,0:28:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.64,0:28:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It first happened on my world\Ntour as Soul King quite suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.30,0:28:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's actually pretty\Nobvious when you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.70,0:28:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If a man can go anywhere undetected, there's\None thing he's going to go looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.46,0:28:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so lucky, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I be dead like he is? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time we\Ngot this show underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some of us to stay and protect\Nthe palace while you're gone, Boss Heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.64,0:29:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.55,0:29:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.88,0:29:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can get\Nthrough the palace gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.10,0:29:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll Station a handful\Nof men here to make
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,sure someone's around to\Nopen it when I Return.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.60,0:29:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you can't\Nlock out the new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.12,0:29:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,More like nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.02,0:29:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You will Never be respected as\Nking if you rule through violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really what you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.40,0:29:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want your last words to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.76,0:29:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have gone for something strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.88,0:29:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My scar, it's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that the stupid human\Nswordsman actually managed to cut me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.18,0:29:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.56,0:29:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's time for my next dose. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.92,0:30:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I feel as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the dangerous\Ntaking that much at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so. Hey, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.48,0:30:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do with the three\NStraw Hats we captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.52,0:30:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.43,0:30:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.84,0:30:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll drown if left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.66,0:30:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And the palace is secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.04,0:30:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one will be able to rescue\Nthem regardless of who comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.20,0:30:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget them. Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the current status\Nof the residents from
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the Fishman district\Nthat we recruited today?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.70,0:30:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, they should be\Nmaking their move as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.24,0:30:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty soon they'll be out of the slums.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.98,0:30:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as once all of the\Ntraders have left or been killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.54,0:30:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,there'll be plenty of\Nhouses on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.68,0:30:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our country will finally be united\Nin its hatred for the pathetic human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.88,0:31:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I found it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright ray of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.34,0:31:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, those fishermen we were\Ndealing with earlier have left,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so the palace is completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.06,0:31:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, it would be if they\Nhadn't left Papagu behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.24,0:31:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.44,0:31:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to ask Papagu to find\Nthe keys to get us out of these chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we need the one\Nto unlock this cage too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.82,0:31:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.90,0:31:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just find one of my swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all we really need to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.62,0:31:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut anything in my way. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.94,0:31:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you ever want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.46,0:31:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the keys, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.52,0:32:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait! The sword! Yeah,\Nyeah! Go find the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.02,0:32:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.00,0:32:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? That's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.62,0:32:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you considered\Nwhat will happen if you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.72,0:32:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,resort to violence\Nwhile on Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time my people have tried to reach\Nout and open their hearts to humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They have been met with nothing\Nbut disappointment and prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.08,0:32:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans like to make us suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.26,0:32:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans hate fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.60,0:32:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They look down on us. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.36,0:32:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what our citizens\Nhave come to believe because
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.88,0:32:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,of the horrible things that\Nhave happened in our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.66,0:32:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And Arlong is a perfect example.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The people here believe that\Nthe humans hunted him when
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.52,0:32:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he went to the surface solely\Nbecause he was a fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you, the people who\Nsuppressed Arlong are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.44,0:32:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What will the islanders think\Nif you crush Heart as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.14,0:33:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Misguided though he may be, Horty's\Naim is to fight against persecution.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.50,0:33:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if it saves us from\Nthis crisis in the long run?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.90,0:33:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If they see a group of\Nhumans attacking him,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it will only solidify the idea that\Nthings will never change between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.12,0:33:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, that's too bad. You're crazy\Nif you think we won't rescue our crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.30,0:33:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless we do something soon, Horty's\Ngoing to take over the whole island!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.90,0:33:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a problem because we have\Na lot of friends that live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Hachi yeah you've kept pretty\Nquiet about who banged you up so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.40,0:33:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I think about\Nit you mentioned before that
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.08,0:33:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart attacks any fish man\Nthat sympathizes with humans
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.42,0:33:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so i guess the reason you're\Nin that sorry state is because
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.98,0:34:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you spoke up for us right\Nwhy is that true already did
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.60,0:34:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,this to you i can't say jimbae\Nwith all that in mind i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.38,0:34:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sure luffy wants to\Nfight so bad because this is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.30,0:34:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,your home too we won't be\Nable to leave the island like
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.36,0:34:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,this we can't turn a blind\Neye there's too much at stake
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.68,0:34:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we're taking a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.32,0:34:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the mermaid paradise\NI've always dreamed of!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, Team Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you keep me here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.12,0:35:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.94,0:35:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
